{"author": null, "category": "instagram", "content": {"constraints": [], "context_unit_ids": ["instagram-posts-2026-07-28-you-search-you-send-options-md-74a2eefcb7:u000001"], "exceptions": [], "goal": null, "kind": "self_report", "prerequisites": [], "steps": [], "summary": {"citations": [{"quote": "You search. You send options. You arrange viewings. Then: \"let me think about it.\" Six weeks gone. Zero deals.", "unit_id": "instagram-posts-2026-07-28-you-search-you-send-options-md-74a2eefcb7:u000001"}], "text": "In real estate, agents search, send options, and arrange viewings only for the client to delay by saying, 'let me think about it,' leading to no deals after six weeks."}, "title": "Deal Closure Frustration", "topic": "real_estate_sales"}, "content_hash": "4a33c086cadbccc16127122bf8c2e2202c007cee2a13ab1538492b297ec06d29", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "instagram-posts-2026-07-28-you-search-you-send-options-md-74a2eefcb7:knowledge:0578dd7617ad7906", "metadata_hash": "df7cdc15cb345010a165ca9f9611f4d0e88c650426b9eae29e6339caf90f2fec", "product": "knowledge", "published_at": "2026-07-28T06:03:09Z", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "post", "source_hash": "8a1f378e024e6d55bd1943254e2b4e1bb3b923322a2ac44c714f890ff4a7910a", "source_id": "instagram-posts-2026-07-28-you-search-you-send-options-md-74a2eefcb7", "source_url": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DbU2WBMlWyH/", "title": "Deal Closure Frustration", "topic": "real_estate_sales", "topic_slug": "real_estate_sales"}
{"author": null, "category": "instagram", "content": {"constraints": [], "context_unit_ids": ["instagram-posts-2026-07-28-you-search-you-send-options-md-74a2eefcb7:u000002"], "exceptions": [], "goal": null, "kind": "claim", "prerequisites": [], "steps": [], "summary": {"citations": [{"quote": "The realistic number: 20–25%. Anyone promising more is lying to keep the client.", "unit_id": "instagram-posts-2026-07-28-you-search-you-send-options-md-74a2eefcb7:u000002"}], "text": "In real estate, the realistic discount number on developer pricing is 20–25%; higher discounts are misleading promises."}, "title": "Price Discount Reality", "topic": "real_estate_sales"}, "content_hash": "4a33c086cadbccc16127122bf8c2e2202c007cee2a13ab1538492b297ec06d29", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "instagram-posts-2026-07-28-you-search-you-send-options-md-74a2eefcb7:knowledge:51b5e3a92c09fa71", "metadata_hash": "df7cdc15cb345010a165ca9f9611f4d0e88c650426b9eae29e6339caf90f2fec", "product": "knowledge", "published_at": "2026-07-28T06:03:09Z", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "post", "source_hash": "8a1f378e024e6d55bd1943254e2b4e1bb3b923322a2ac44c714f890ff4a7910a", "source_id": "instagram-posts-2026-07-28-you-search-you-send-options-md-74a2eefcb7", "source_url": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DbU2WBMlWyH/", "title": "Price Discount Reality", "topic": "real_estate_sales", "topic_slug": "real_estate_sales"}
{"author": null, "category": "instagram", "content": {"constraints": [], "context_unit_ids": ["instagram-posts-2026-07-28-you-search-you-send-options-md-74a2eefcb7:u000002", "instagram-posts-2026-07-28-you-search-you-send-options-md-74a2eefcb7:u000003"], "exceptions": [], "goal": null, "kind": "advice", "prerequisites": [], "steps": [], "summary": {"citations": [{"quote": "\"A real distressed deal is when several buyers are already sending cheques through their agents.\"", "unit_id": "instagram-posts-2026-07-28-you-search-you-send-options-md-74a2eefcb7:u000002"}], "text": "A real distressed deal in real estate is one where multiple buyers are sending cheques, and the buyer must be ready to decide quickly to secure the discount."}, "title": "Distressed Deal Explanation", "topic": "real_estate_sales"}, "content_hash": "4a33c086cadbccc16127122bf8c2e2202c007cee2a13ab1538492b297ec06d29", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "instagram-posts-2026-07-28-you-search-you-send-options-md-74a2eefcb7:knowledge:530e275dafc53507", "metadata_hash": "df7cdc15cb345010a165ca9f9611f4d0e88c650426b9eae29e6339caf90f2fec", "product": "knowledge", "published_at": "2026-07-28T06:03:09Z", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "post", "source_hash": "8a1f378e024e6d55bd1943254e2b4e1bb3b923322a2ac44c714f890ff4a7910a", "source_id": "instagram-posts-2026-07-28-you-search-you-send-options-md-74a2eefcb7", "source_url": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DbU2WBMlWyH/", "title": "Distressed Deal Explanation", "topic": "real_estate_sales", "topic_slug": "real_estate_sales"}
{"author": null, "category": "instagram", "content": {"context_unit_ids": ["instagram-posts-2026-07-28-you-search-you-send-options-md-74a2eefcb7:u000001"], "cue": {"citations": [{"quote": "Then: \"let me think about it.\"", "unit_id": "instagram-posts-2026-07-28-you-search-you-send-options-md-74a2eefcb7:u000001"}], "text": "Client says, 'let me think about it.'"}, "diagnosis": null, "kind": "reported_exchange", "outcome": null, "rationale": null, "response": null, "situation": {"citations": [{"quote": "You search. You send options. You arrange viewings. Then: \"let me think about it.\" Six weeks gone. Zero deals.", "unit_id": "instagram-posts-2026-07-28-you-search-you-send-options-md-74a2eefcb7:u000001"}], "text": "An agent experiences clients delaying decision-making after arranging viewings."}, "speaker_id": null, "strategy": null, "title": "Client Interest Delay", "topic": "client_interaction"}, "content_hash": "4a33c086cadbccc16127122bf8c2e2202c007cee2a13ab1538492b297ec06d29", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "instagram-posts-2026-07-28-you-search-you-send-options-md-74a2eefcb7:cases:487cbd9593481611", "metadata_hash": "df7cdc15cb345010a165ca9f9611f4d0e88c650426b9eae29e6339caf90f2fec", "product": "cases", "published_at": "2026-07-28T06:03:09Z", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "post", "source_hash": "8a1f378e024e6d55bd1943254e2b4e1bb3b923322a2ac44c714f890ff4a7910a", "source_id": "instagram-posts-2026-07-28-you-search-you-send-options-md-74a2eefcb7", "source_url": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DbU2WBMlWyH/", "title": "Client Interest Delay", "topic": "client_interaction", "topic_slug": "client_interaction"}
