{"author": null, "category": "instagram", "content": {"context_unit_ids": ["instagram-posts-2026-07-28-you-search-you-send-options-md-74a2eefcb7:u000001"], "form": "tone", "observation": {"citations": [{"quote": "You search. You send options. You arrange viewings. Then: \"let me think about it.\" Six weeks gone.", "unit_id": "instagram-posts-2026-07-28-you-search-you-send-options-md-74a2eefcb7:u000001"}], "text": "The narrative expresses frustration through a series of short, declarative sentences highlighting actions followed by client indecision."}, "purpose": null, "speaker_id": null, "title": "Frustration Narrative", "topic": "real_estate_sales"}, "content_hash": "4a33c086cadbccc16127122bf8c2e2202c007cee2a13ab1538492b297ec06d29", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "instagram-posts-2026-07-28-you-search-you-send-options-md-74a2eefcb7:expression:ff6a295939928e48", "metadata_hash": "df7cdc15cb345010a165ca9f9611f4d0e88c650426b9eae29e6339caf90f2fec", "product": "expression", "published_at": "2026-07-28T06:03:09Z", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "post", "source_hash": "8a1f378e024e6d55bd1943254e2b4e1bb3b923322a2ac44c714f890ff4a7910a", "source_id": "instagram-posts-2026-07-28-you-search-you-send-options-md-74a2eefcb7", "source_url": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DbU2WBMlWyH/", "title": "Frustration Narrative", "topic": "real_estate_sales", "topic_slug": "real_estate_sales"}
{"author": null, "category": "instagram", "content": {"context_unit_ids": ["instagram-posts-2026-07-28-you-search-you-send-options-md-74a2eefcb7:u000002", "instagram-posts-2026-07-28-you-search-you-send-options-md-74a2eefcb7:u000003"], "form": "structure", "observation": {"citations": [{"quote": "Will you be able to decide – sometimes without even seeing the property – and give me the cheque,", "unit_id": "instagram-posts-2026-07-28-you-search-you-send-options-md-74a2eefcb7:u000002"}], "text": "The phrase is structured as a direct question asking clients about their readiness to act quickly on a property deal."}, "purpose": null, "speaker_id": null, "title": "Direct Client Questioning", "topic": "real_estate_sales"}, "content_hash": "4a33c086cadbccc16127122bf8c2e2202c007cee2a13ab1538492b297ec06d29", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "instagram-posts-2026-07-28-you-search-you-send-options-md-74a2eefcb7:expression:ec47a2f4377fbeaf", "metadata_hash": "df7cdc15cb345010a165ca9f9611f4d0e88c650426b9eae29e6339caf90f2fec", "product": "expression", "published_at": "2026-07-28T06:03:09Z", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "post", "source_hash": "8a1f378e024e6d55bd1943254e2b4e1bb3b923322a2ac44c714f890ff4a7910a", "source_id": "instagram-posts-2026-07-28-you-search-you-send-options-md-74a2eefcb7", "source_url": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DbU2WBMlWyH/", "title": "Direct Client Questioning", "topic": "real_estate_sales", "topic_slug": "real_estate_sales"}
